  {
   "vo": "The best fast bowler of this era, against the two greatest batters of the nineties. जसप्रीत बुमराह versus सचिन तेंदुलकर and Brian Lara. Who wins?",
   "scene": {
    "type": "matchup",
    "head": {
     "t": "DREAM MATCHUP",
     "sub": "ILLUSTRATIVE"
