    }
   }
  },
  {
   "vo": "First, the batters. सचिन, the most complete batter of his generation, with fifty-one Test hundreds. Lara, the most explosive, and still the only man to score four hundred in a Test innings.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "compare",
    "head": {
     "t": "THE BATTERS"
    },
    "a": {
