    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "vo": "And the bowler. A short, stuttering run-up, and a whippy arm that releases the ball later than batters expect. A yorker on demand. A slower ball from the same action. And in March twenty twenty-six, four for fifteen in a World Cup final.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "trajectory",
    "head": {
     "t": "BUMRAH'S WEAPONS",
     "sub": "ILLUSTRATIVE · SIDE-ON"
    },
    "hl": [
     "YORKER"
    ],
    "balls": [
     {
      "length": 6.5,
      "label": "LATE RELEASE",
      "c": "ink",
      "at": 0.08
     },
     {
      "length": 0.8,
      "label": "YORKER",
      "c": "gold"
     },
     {
      "length": 4.2,
      "loop": 0.45,
      "label": "SLOWER BALL",
      "c": "blue"
     }
    ],
    "bowler_c": "gold",
    "note": "4/15 in the 2026 T20 World Cup final",
    "noteat": 0.7
   }
  },
  {
   "vo": "Now the matchups. सचिन against the yorker: his compact, straight bat is the best answer there is to a full ball. Lara against the late release: that famous high backlift needs time, and बुमराह takes time away. And both of them against a slower ball this well disguised, something few bowlers in the nineties could offer.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "list",
    "head": {
     "t": "THE KEY MATCHUPS"
    },
    "items": [
     {
      "h": "SACHIN VS THE YORKER",
      "d": "A compact, straight bat: the best answer to full balls",
      "c": "blue",
      "at": 0.1
     },
     {
      "h": "LARA VS THE LATE RELEASE",
      "d": "A high backlift needs time. Bumrah takes it away",
      "c": "red",
      "at": 0.4
     },
     {
      "h": "BOTH VS THE SLOWER BALL",
      "d": "A disguise few 90s bowlers could match",
      "c": "gold",
      "at": 0.7
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "vo": "So here's our imagined over. Ball one, to सचिन: a late outswinger, left alone. Ball two: fuller, and driven straight back past the bowler for four. Ball three: the yorker, dug out just in time. Ball four: worked off the hips for one. Lara on strike. Ball five: a hint of width, and he cuts it for four. Ball six: the slower ball. Lara's through the shot early. Caught at mid-off.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "over",
    "head": {
     "t": "OUR IMAGINED OVER",
